        "text": "[Session Handoff] - **Current Action:** Just arrived in Epsilon Eridani system after jumping from Sirius.  \n- **Immediate Next Step:** Locate an asteroid belt to mine copper ore for the Copper Requisition mission.  \n- **Location:** Epsilon Eridani system (delta_major_star).  \n- **Ship:** Active, cargo space 0/70 used.  \n- **Credits:** 570cr.  \n- **Cargo:** 1 Nickel Ore (not mission-critical).  \n- **Active Goal:** Mine 25 Copper Ore for the Copper Requisition mission.  \n- Recent Events: Failed to mine copper in Sol and Sirius; Main Belt depleted, Kuiper Ice Fields unsuitable, no asteroid belts in Sirius."
