      {
        "index": 2,
        "created_at": "2026-10-12 01:36:48",
        "text": "Tonight was a quiet run. I mined 2 Iron Ore and 2 Nickel Ore in the Main Belt, selling them for a modest 110 credits. The belt was thin, but I worked steadily and brought the ship home. Refueled completely to avoid any mishaps. The board will see a small gain tonight, but it’s honest work."
